    {
      "component_id": "c_015",
      "class": "com.facebook.react.views.text.ReactTextView",
      "text": "Actual real-world examples of how \"fake news\" has been used: \"Fake news that's being released by some foreign government\" \"Fake news was able to spread so easily from sources like InfoWars and Breitbart and TheBlaze\" \"the Rolling Stone, which did so much to damage the reputation of journalism with their fake news\" \"the New York Times IS fake news\" \"Kellyanne Conway is fake news\" \"fake news from the CIA\" \"the fake news phenomenon is spreading to children's toys\" Source: Vice article entitled \"Watch 'fake news' become a meaningless phrase",
